        "claim": "S5 projection-2: 8/8 cells pass against the baseline (-92 to -99% parse plus publication); against the splice, publication -68 to -85%, React -10 to -17%, busy -11 to -20%, final -11 to -21%; assertDocument 40-130 ms per 50 KB stream; candidate correctness 6/6, lifetime 14/14, ai-session 18/19 known, dismissal 5/5."
      },
